## Coordination protocol (shared board)
- Before acting, read the board: [`{{.BoardRel}}`]({{.BoardRel}}). Pick up any `@{{.Role}}:` requests not yet marked `[DONE]`.
- Do the work, then **append your proof** under the request — a runnable artifact (test/CLI output, audit sample) or a visual capture for UI. Do NOT write `[DONE]` yourself; the lead verifies and marks it.
- After each session, update your `### {{.Role}}` section on the board with status + next steps.
- Need something from another role? Append `@<role>: <request>` with a clear Definition of Done (acceptance checks + the proof it must produce).
- The team hook pokes this pane when a fresh `@{{.Role}}:` request lands, and re-lists pending ones when the pane boots — re-read the board when nudged.

